WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Mission services and business services depend on ICT systems, networks and configuration items, or CIs.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Servers, workstations and other CIs form the technical foundation. Blue SW icons identify software installed on servers.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Communication paths connect CIs across networks. Recorded system membership gives those components a shared purpose.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Follow dependencies to see which systems support each service. Select a layer in the guide, or highlight all components.
